1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:04,030
Even the doctors did not know which gas it was.

2
00:00:04,080 --> 00:00:07,110
The morning of 3 December. Hamidia Hospital.

3
00:00:07,160 --> 00:00:10,910
Thousands arrived, fighting for breath.

4
00:00:10,960 --> 00:00:14,750
Their eyes burned, and their chests felt on fire.

5
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:19,090
There were not enough beds. Patients lay in corridors and on the floor.

6
00:00:19,140 --> 00:00:21,970
No one had the right treatment for it.

7
00:00:22,020 --> 00:00:26,670
In the first few days alone, tens of thousands needed treatment.

8
00:00:26,720 --> 00:00:30,210
By morning, the lanes of the city had fallen silent.

9
00:00:30,260 --> 00:00:34,670
Thousands of animals died too, and the leaves turned yellow and fell.

10
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,670
For the full story, subscribe to the channel.

